'''Sage of Selection Darvin''' (淘の賢者ダーヴィン, ''Tō no Kenja Dāvin'', '''Sage of Selection Darvin''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] enemy that appears in [[Zero Legends]]. He is the enemy version of [[Master of Selection Darvin (Special Cat)|Master of Selection Darvin]]. He was added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Sage of Selection Darvin
|image = E 772.png
|first appearance = [[Endless Forms Most Beautiful]]
|money drop = 7,000¢ - 27,650¢
}}

==Enemy==
This Alien/Sage midranger has an immense amount of health, high stamina, and a disjointed [[Multi-Hit]] that allows him to hit up to 651 from a comparatively short standing range of 350, with the outer hit dealing half the damage of the inner one. Cats that survive his attacks will not only be [[Curse|Cursed]], but suffer a penalty to their ongoing cooldown that only increases the more of their kind are hit at once, thinning the flow of incoming reinforcements.

